library MetadataContent {
    string internal constant TOKEN_DESCRIPTION = "A little Mycelium Friend, assembled from six chosen traits in tiny vector beads. A face, a point of view, and something it likes doing.\\n\\nFirst the mushrooms. Then the forest. This collection raises funds for Magic Forest: land, a forest, and a future Art Hub in Spain. Many trees and fungi grow through partnership. Our story begins with that same spirit.\\n\\nOriginal artwork, traits, and descriptions live entirely on Ethereum. Magic Forest began with people who chose to help an idea take root. Mycelium Friends carries that same spirit as the project grows.\\n\\nMeet this friend:";
    string internal constant PROJECT_URL = "https://mycelium.magicforest.land/";
    string internal constant COLLECTION_PREFIX = "{\"name\":\"Mycelium Friends\",\"description\":\"Mycelium is a gathering of little mushroom friends, made from tiny vector beads and stored entirely on Ethereum. Choose every trait, from cap to hobby. Bring your own kind of curious.\\n\\nChoose a stem, a cap, a temperament, glasses, an accessory, and a hobby. Six parts, one particular friend. The artwork is made from tiny vector beads, and its original traits, image, and descriptions live entirely on Ethereum. No reveal to wait for. No image server to keep alive.\\n\\nFirst the mushrooms. Then the forest.\\n\\nFungi help forests thrive, from partnerships with tree roots to the recycling of fallen leaves. These little friends celebrate the lives beneath the trees, and the people gathering to grow a forest together.\\n\\nWe are raising funds for Magic Forest: to secure land in Spain, plant a forest, and create an Art Hub where people can make things, learn, and spend time together. Donations started the story. This collection is another way to help it grow.\\n\\nExisting donors receive the first invitation to claim, before public sales: a thank-you for helping the idea take root.\\n\\nMagic Forest began with people who believed in the idea and chose to help it take root. Mycelium Friends carries that same spirit: small characters, an on-chain collection, and a real-world project growing toward land, trees, and a place for creativity in Spain.\\n\\nA small friend to keep. A real forest to help grow.\",\"image\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,";
